# 🎬 SeeCut: Agent-Native Media Editor & MCP Write Protocol (M2)

## 📌 Executive Overview
- **Repository**: `Stormycry-cryp/seecut` (branch: `codex/seecut-unified-mac-candidate`)
- **Lineage**: Deep synthesis and evolution of `jub0t/Concat` (Rust NLE), `robbietilton/Compositor` (layer/PSD canvas), and `HBAI-Ltd/Toonflow-app` (node-based AI workflow).
- **Core Thesis**: Moving beyond static LLM plugins into a unified desktop creative workstation where autonomous AI agents drive the actual UI/canvas/timeline through deterministic MCP protocols.

